<view class="page {{reduceMotion?'reduce-motion':''}}"><view class="row between"><view><view class="title">{{photoPath?'这一次，遇见了什么？':'去大自然里走走'}}</view><view class="sub">拍一拍 · 认识身边的自然</view></view><text class="pill">观察日记</text></view>
<block wx:if="{{!photoPath}}"><view class="shutter-card spaced" bindtap="openCamera"><view class="camera-symbol camera-drawing" aria-hidden="true"></view><view class="section">拍一张</view><view class="sub">对准植物、昆虫或鸟类都可以</view></view><view class="entry-grid spaced"><view class="entry-card" bindtap="album"><view class="entry-icon album-drawing" aria-hidden="true"></view><text class="entry-title">相册导入</text><text class="sub">选一张你拍过的照片</text></view><view class="entry-card" bindtap="nearby"><view class="entry-icon habitat-drawing" aria-hidden="true"></view><text class="entry-title">探索生境</text><text class="sub">静态观察指南，不使用定位</text></view></view><view class="notice spaced">拍下的照片会做成你的专属卡片，由你来确认它的身份。</view></block>
<block wx:else><image class="preview spaced" src="{{photoPath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="row between"><text class="sub">照片仅暂存，成功制卡后才保存</text><button class="link" bindtap="reset">重拍</button><button class="link" bindtap="album">换照片</button></view>
<button wx:if="{{pending}}" class="secondary spaced" bindtap="resume">继续查看已生成的卡片 →</button><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="identify" disabled="{{aiBusy}}">{{aiBusy?'正在识别…':'开始识别'}}</button><view wx:if="{{identifyError}}" class="notice spaced">{{identifyError}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{needsRecognitionConsent}}" class="notice spaced">仅上传所选照片至私有云并交给百度鉴别。之后不再询问，可在「我的」关闭。<button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="acceptRecognition">同意并识别</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{aiBusy}}" class="notice spaced">正在识别这张照片<view>照片会交给识别服务判断它是什么物种，大约需要几秒钟。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{!aiBusy&&(mode==='recognized'||mode==='needs_confirmation')}}" class="panel spaced">
<view class="section">{{mode==='recognized'?'看起来是它':'认出了几个可能，你来确认'}}</view>
<view class="candidates"><view wx:for="{{recognition.candidates}}" wx:key="speciesId" class="candidate {{species.id===item.speciesId?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.speciesId}}" bindtap="candidate"><image src="{{item.thumb||photoPath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text>{{item.zh||item.speciesId}}</text><text class="sub">{{item.confidenceText}}</text></view></view>
<button class="primary" disabled="{{!species||busy}}" bindtap="confirm">直接制卡</button><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{!species||busy}}" bindtap="confirmArt">AI 艺术制卡</button><view class="hint">选择 AI 即同意上传本张照片至私有云交给混元创作；失败需重试或主动选择原图。艺术图不作为鉴别依据。</view><view wx:if="{{artProgress}}" class="notice">{{artProgress}}</view>
<view class="hint spaced">置信度仅供参考，认对了再确认。无法确认时请重拍。</view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{!aiBusy&&mode==='unknown'}}" class="notice spaced">这张照片没能认出来<view>可能不在当前物种库里，或不清楚。请重新识别或重拍，不会保存失败记录。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{artFailed}}" class="notice spaced"><button bindtap="confirmArt" disabled="{{busy}}">重试艺术制卡</button><button bindtap="useOriginal" disabled="{{busy}}">用原图制卡</button></view></block><view class="row between spaced" bindtap="odds"><text class="section">公开工艺概率</text><text class="sub">{{showOdds?'收起 −':'查看 ＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{showOdds}}" class="panel spaced"><view wx:for="{{probabilities}}" wx:key="key" class="row between odds-row"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="green">{{item.probability}}%</text></view><view class="sub">物种由照片决定，卡面工艺单独随机。重新打开同一张卡不会重抽；编号为本地记录号，无限量发行承诺。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{today.length}}" class="spaced"><view class="section">今日已收集 · {{today.length}}</view><view class="recent"><view wx:for="{{today}}" wx:key="id" class="recent-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openCard"><collectible card="{{item}}"/></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{undiscovered.length}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">待你发现</view><view wx:for="{{undiscovered}}" wx:key="id" class="draft-row"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text>{{item.zh}}</text><text class="sub">{{item.season}}</text></view></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{cameraOpen}}" class="camera-screen"><camera class="camera-live" device-position="back" flash="{{flash}}" bindinitdone="ready" binderror="cameraFail"/><cover-view class="camera-top"><cover-view bindtap="closeCamera">返回</cover-view><cover-view bindtap="flash">{{flash==='on'?'⚡ 开启':'ϟ 关闭'}}</cover-view></cover-view><cover-view wx:if="{{cameraError}}" class="camera-error">{{cameraError}}</cover-view><cover-view class="camera-bottom"><cover-view bindtap="album">相册</cover-view><cover-view class="capture {{cameraReady?'':'disabled'}}" bindtap="shoot">{{busy?'保存中':'拍摄'}}</cover-view><cover-view bindtap="settings">权限</cover-view></cover-view></view>
